1
00:00:00,647 --> 00:00:01,707
(Wil:)Are you okay?

2
00:00:01,881 --> 00:00:04,511
(Sheldon:)You're asking a lot of questions,
Wil Wheaton.

3
00:00:04,684 --> 00:00:06,384
(Sheldon:)As a matter of idle curiosity...

4
00:00:06,553 --> 00:00:11,253
(Sheldon:)...which of your shrubberies do you feel
would benefit from a thorough vomiting?

5
00:00:11,758 --> 00:00:13,748
(Sheldon:)Never mind, I'll choose.

6
00:00:19,599 --> 00:00:22,159
(Sheldon:)You were so good in Stand by Me.

7
00:00:29,809 --> 00:00:32,569
(Sheldon:)Hello, I'm Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

8
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:36,645
(Penny:)Welcome to
Sheldon Cooper Presents Fun With Flags.

9
00:00:37,951 --> 00:00:39,881
(Sheldon:)Get ready for a very special episode...

10
00:00:40,053 --> 00:00:43,993
(Sheldon:)...where we explore the flags of the popular
entertainment franchise Star Trek.

11
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:47,557
(Sheldon:)And to help us,
I'm pleased to introduce a special guest.

12
00:00:47,727 --> 00:00:52,167
(Sheldon:)Surprisingly, it only took gas money and
the promise of free food to get him here.

13
00:00:52,332 --> 00:00:54,462
(Sheldon:)Mr. LeVar Burton.

14
00:00:56,035 --> 00:00:57,935
(LeVar:)Hey, Sheldon. It's a pleasure to be here.

15
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:01,404
(LeVar:)- Well, we've got some interesting flags...
- Cut.

16
00:01:02,675 --> 00:01:05,545
(Amy:)Yikes, this guy is worse than Wil Wheaton.

17
00:01:09,115 --> 00:01:12,575
(Sheldon:)I don't know what she's talking about,
but I'm obligated to agree with her.

18
00:01:12,752 --> 00:01:15,912
(Sheldon:)- She's my girlfriend.
- Ah. I hear you, brother.

19
00:01:16,089 --> 00:01:18,389
(LeVar:)I still get lunch, right?

